The {{JP|'''Titan's Blazing Sword'''|巨大の光炎剣|Kyodai no Kōen Ken}} is a giant sword capable of destroying any [[Monster Spawner]], created using the [[Mod Power#Imagination|Imagination]] [[Mod Power]] in ''[[Minecraft: The Manga]]''.

== Appearance ==
The Titan's Blazing Sword is a massive glowing sword.

== Functionality ==
When stabbed into a [[Monster Spawner]], the Titan's Blazing Sword instantly destroys it. This works even on Spawners with the [[Mod Power#Tenacity|"Tenacity"]] [[Mod Power]], which makes them otherwise unbreakable, even to [[Platinum (character)|Platinum]]'s [[Mod Power#Tenacity|Block Piercer]].

